<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" xmlns:ns1="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml" xml:lang="jv-Latn-ID">
<title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah</title>
<metadata>
  <ns1:content-id>m81244</ns1:content-id>
  <ns1:title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah</ns1:title>
  <ns1:abstract><para id="para-00001">Sawise ngrampungake bagean iki, sampeyan bakal bisa:</para><list id="list-00001">
<item>Nggunakake notasi panambahan</item>
<item>Nggambarake panambahan wilangan cacah nganggo model</item>
<item>Nambah wilangan cacah tanpa model</item>
<item>Ngowahi frasa tembung dadi notasi matematika</item>
<item>Nambah wilangan cacah ing penerapan</item>
</list></ns1:abstract>
  <ns1:uuid>8069044b-6fb1-49bf-b03a-64988f9b1ddd</ns1:uuid>
</metadata>

<content>
<note id="fs-id2299412" class="be-prepared">
<para id="fs-id2646470">Sadurunge miwiti, garapen kuis kesiapan iki.</para>
<exercise id="fs-idm207409024">
<problem id="fs-idm215457168">
<para id="fs-idm214637312">Wilangan pira sing digambarake nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>?<newline />
<media id="fs-id2778433" alt="Gambar dumadi saka telung bagean. Bagean kapisan yaiku rong persegi sing saben-saben ngemot 100 blok, ambane 10 blok lan dhuwure 10 blok. Bagean kapindho yaiku sawijining batang horisontal sing ngemot 10 blok. Bagean katelu yaiku 5 blok satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001_img.jpg" />
</media><newline />
Yen wangsulan sampeyan salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id2222880" document="m81243" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm219309424">
<para id="fs-idm216142416"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>215</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1122444" class="be-prepared">
<exercise id="fs-idm218505136">
<problem id="fs-idm221149472">
<para id="fs-idm218825920">Tulisen wilangan telung atus patang puluh loro éwu enem nganggo digit.<newline />
Yen wangsulan sampeyan salah, sinaunen maneh <link target-id="fs-id3202693" document="m81243" />.</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm207579776">
<para id="fs-idm221421664"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>342</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>006</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<section id="fs-id2601285">
<title>Nggunakake Notasi Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id3165690">Sawijining mahasiswa duwe pakaryan paruh wektu. Minggu kepungkur dheweke nyambut gawe suwene <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> jam ing dina Senen lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> jam ing dina Jemuwah. Kanggo nemtokake gunggung jam kerjane minggu kepungkur, dheweke nambahake <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id2606793">Operasi panambahan nggabungake wilangan kanggo ngasilake sawijining <term id="term-00001">gunggung</term>. Notasi sing digunakake kanggo nemtokake gunggung <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> yaiku:</para>
<equation id="fs-id1474530" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
<para id="fs-id2619407">Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">telu ditambah papat</emphasis>, lan asile yaiku gunggung telu lan papat. Wilangan <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> diarani suku-suku panambahan. Pranyatan matematika sing ngemot wilangan lan operasi diarani ekspresi.</para><note id="fs-id1282344">
<title>Notasi Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id1966740">Kanggo nerangake panambahan, kita bisa nggunakake simbol lan tembung.</para>
<table id="fs-id2711498" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel kanthi rong baris lan limang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur yaiku baris irah-irahan. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, kolom kasebut diwenehi label Operasi, Notasi, Ekspresi, Diwaca, lan Asil. Ing baris kapindho, saka kiwa menyang tengen, ana panambahan, tandha tambah, ekspresi 3 ditambah 4, wacan telu ditambah papat, lan gunggung 3 lan 4.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry align="left">Diwaca</entry>
<entry align="left">Asil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">telu ditambah papat</entry>
<entry align="left">gunggung <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1519902">
<exercise id="fs-id2294573"><problem id="fs-id1330068">
<para id="fs-id2703725">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:<list id="eip-id1168287109262" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>12</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id2294519">
<title>Panyelesaian</title><list id="eip-id1168287334447" list-type="labeled-item" class="circled"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Ekspresi iki ngemot tandha tambah sing nyambungake suku panambahan 7 lan 1. Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">pitu ditambah siji</emphasis>. Asile yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung pitu lan siji</emphasis>.</item>
<item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Ekspresi iki ngemot tandha tambah sing nyambungake suku panambahan 12 lan 14. Iki diwaca <emphasis effect="italics">rolas ditambah patbelas</emphasis>. Asile yaiku <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung rolas lan patbelas</emphasis>.</item></list></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2202625" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1386428"><problem id="fs-id2842881">
<para id="fs-id1549906">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289469583" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1948344"><list id="eip-id1168288479736" list-type="labeled-item"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> wolu ditambah papat; gunggung wolu lan papat</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> wolulas ditambah sewelas; gunggung wolulas lan sewelas</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2216255" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2334163"><problem id="fs-id1525211">
<para id="fs-id1630183">Owahana notasi matematika iki dadi tembung:</para>
<list id="eip-id1168289631763" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>21</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>200</m:mn></m:math></item></list></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1577525"><list id="eip-id1168288338262" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> selikur ditambah nembelas; gunggung selikur lan nembelas</item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> satus ditambah rong atus; gunggung satus lan rong atus</item></list></solution>
</exercise></note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2145437"><title>Nggambarake Panambahan Wilangan Cacah nganggo Model</title><para id="fs-id1484984">Sejatine, panambahan yaiku kegiatan ngetung. Kita bakal nggambarake panambahan nganggo blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Elinga yen siji blok makili <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan siji batang makili <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Ayo miwiti kanthi nggambarake ekspresi panambahan sing lagi wae dirembug, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
<para id="fs-id1567091">Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> mula kita bisa nggunakake blok satuan.</para>
<table id="eip-167" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot katrangan lan kolom tengen ngemot blok basis-10. Baris kapisan nerangake yen kita miwiti kanthi nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo telung blok, banjur nampilake 3 blok satuan kanthi label 3 ing ngisore. Baris sabanjure nerangake yen kita banjur nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo patang blok, banjur nampilake klompok 3 blok lan klompok 4 blok kanthi label 3 lan 4. Baris pungkasan njaluk kita ngetung gunggung kabeh blok, banjur nampilake 7 blok satuan kanthi label 7.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita miwiti kanthi nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo 3 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288475996" alt="Telung persegi kosong ditampilake ing ndhuwur digit 3 kanthi latar putih."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, kita nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo 4 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288501014" alt="Rong klompok persegi kosong ditampilake. Klompok kapisan ngemot telung persegi kanthi label '3', lan klompok kapindho ngemot patang persegi kanthi label '4'; gambar iki nuduhake dhasar ngetung utawa nglompokake."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen gunggung kabeh blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288501034" alt="Digit '7' ditampilake ing ngisor barisan pitung persegi kosong."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_019_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1607848">Kabeh ana <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> blok. Kita nggunakake tandha padha karo <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>(=)</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo nuduhake gunggung. Ukara matematika sing nyatakake yen rong ekspresi nduweni nilai padha diarani persamaan. Dadi, kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para><note id="fs-id1171103645619" class="manipulative-math">Nggarap kegiatan lembar kerja matematika manipulatif “Nggambarake Panambahan Wilangan Cacah nganggo Model” bakal mbantu sampeyan luwih mangerteni panambahan wilangan cacah.</note><example id="fs-id1239606"><exercise id="fs-id1471255"><problem id="fs-id3961697">
<para id="fs-id1899387">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1969376">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1883656"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ateges gunggung <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math>.</para><para id="eip-id1170195494564">Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang 10, mula kita bisa nggunakake blok satuan.</para>

<table id="eip-951" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki dumadi saka rong kolom: kolom kiwa ngemot katrangan lan kolom tengen ngemot blok basis-10. Baris kapisan njaluk kita nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo 2 blok lan nampilake rong blok satuan kanthi label 2. Baris kapindho njaluk kita nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo 6 blok lan nampilake klompok 2 blok kanthi label 2, kapisah saka klompok enem blok kanthi label 6. Baris pungkasan njaluk kita ngetung gunggung kabeh blok lan nampilake wolung blok satuan kanthi label 8."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>

  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapisan nganggo 2 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287484993" alt="Rong persegi kanthi bingkai biru enom ditampilake ing ndhuwur wilangan 2 kanggo nuduhake rong barang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapindho nganggo 6 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287042738" alt="Gambar nampilake rong persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 2 lan enem persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 6."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen gunggung kabeh blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287554343" alt="Gambar nampilake wolung persegi biru enom ing ndhuwur wilangan 8."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_016_img-04.png" /></media><newline />Kabeh ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok, mula <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>

</tbody>


</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1718496" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2792546">
<problem id="fs-id1404551">
<para id="fs-id1395632">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1833338">
<para id="fs-id1171103910560"><newline /><media id="fs-id2198152" alt="Gambar nampilake telung persegi klawu, banjur panggonan kosong, banjur enem persegi klawu maneh. Ing ngisor gambar kasebut ana persamaan matematika '3 + 6 = 9' sing nuduhake gunggung persegi kasebut.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_006_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2454904" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1886370">
<problem id="fs-id1374158">
<para id="fs-id1202710">Gambarna nganggo model: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1241970">
<para id="fs-id1171105209419"><newline /><media id="fs-id1790053" alt="Gambar nggunakake persegi klawu kanggo nggambarake soal panambahan 5 + 1.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_007_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1825926">Yen asile ana <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok satuan utawa luwih, kita bakal ngijolake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> blok karo siji batang.</para>
<example id="fs-id998472"><exercise id="fs-id1792383">
<problem id="fs-id1569336">
<para id="fs-id1550016">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1471782">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1171103442800"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ateges gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>

<table id="eip-555" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki dumadi saka rong kolom. Kolom kiwa ngemot katrangan lan kolom tengen ngemot blok basis-10. Baris kapisan njaluk kita nggambarake wilangan kapisan nganggo limang blok, banjur nampilake limang blok satuan kanthi label 5. Baris kapindho njaluk kita nggambarake wilangan kapindho nganggo 8 blok, banjur nampilake klompok 5 blok lan klompok 8 blok kanthi label 5 lan 8. Baris sabanjure njaluk kita ngetung asile. Amarga ana luwih saka 10 blok, 10 blok satuan diijolake karo 1 batang puluhan; sepuluh blok wiwitan dikupengi garis lan dituduhake menyang siji batang basis-10 abang, dene telung blok biru isih kari. Baris pungkasan nyatakake yen saiki ana 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan, yaiku 13.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Saben suku panambahan luwih cilik tinimbang 10, mula kita bisa nggunakake blok satuan.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapisan nganggo 5 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288219210" alt="Gambar nampilake limang persegi kosong klawu enom kanthi garis pinggir peteng sing disusun horisontal. Wilangan '5' ditampilake pas ing ngisor tengahing limang persegi kanthi latar putih kanggo nuduhake cacahe."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna wilangan kapindho nganggo 8 blok.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288219228" alt="Gambar nampilake 5 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai lan wilangan 5 ing ngisore, uga sawijining klompok wolung persegi klawu kanthi bingkai lan wilangan 8 ing ngisore."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Etungen asile. Ana luwih saka 10 blok, mula kita ngijolake 10 blok satuan karo 1 batang puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168288217527" alt="Gambar nampilake rong klompok sing saben-saben ngemot 5 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai lan siji klompok 3 persegi klawu kanthi bingkai. Rong klompok isi 5 persegi dikupengi garis lan diowahi dadi siji klompok 10 blok abang ing ngisore, kanthi klompok telung persegi klawu ing sandhinge."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_017_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Saiki kita duwe 1 puluhan lan 3 satuan, yaiku 13.</entry>
    <entry>5 + 8 = 13</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="eip-571">Gatekna yen bagean model bisa disebut blok satuan lan batang puluhan, utawa dicekak dadi <emphasis effect="italics">satuan</emphasis> lan <emphasis effect="italics">puluhan</emphasis>. Sabanjure kita bakal nggunakake sebutan cekak kasebut, nanging elinga yen tegese padha.</para></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1762424" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2265162">
<problem id="fs-id2562850">
<para id="fs-id1827907">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2140822">
<para id="fs-id1171105511335"><newline /><media id="fs-id4346927" alt="Gambar nggunakake blok kanggo nuduhake soal panambahan 5 + 7.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_010_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1408852" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1863239">
<problem id="fs-id2496120">
<para id="fs-id1344440">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2129995">
<para id="fs-id1171105491944"><newline /><media id="fs-id2171528" alt="Gambar nggunakake blok kanggo nuduhake soal panambahan 6 + 8.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_011_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1608773">Sabanjure, kita bakal nggambarake panambahan wilangan rong digit nganggo model.
</para><example id="fs-id1392030"><exercise id="fs-id1939376"><problem id="fs-id1243266">
<para id="fs-id1372968">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1966628">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="eip-id2450011"><m:math><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math> ateges gunggung 17 lan 26.</para>
<table id="eip-93" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Gambar iki nduweni telung kolom. Kolom kiwa ing baris kapisan nyatakake 'gambarna 17 nganggo model'. Kolom tengah nyatakake '1 puluhan lan 7 satuan', dene kolom tengen nampilake siji batang isi 10 blok lan 7 blok satuan. Baris sabanjure nyatakake 'gambarna 26 nganggo model'; kolom tengah nyatakake '2 puluhan lan 6 satuan', banjur kolom tengen nampilake 2 batang puluhan sing ditumpuk lan enem blok satuan. Baris sabanjure nyatakake 'gabungna'; kolom tengah nyatakake '3 puluhan lan 13 satuan', banjur kolom tengen nampilake 3 batang puluhan lan rong klompok blok satuan kanthi gunggung 13. Baris pungkasan nyatakake 'ijolna 10 satuan karo 1 puluhan', banjur nampilake 4 batang puluhan lan 3 blok satuan."><label />
<tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna 17 nganggo model.</entry>
    <entry>1 puluhan lan 7 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289477492" alt="Gambar nampilake klompok 10 blok ing sisih kiwa lan klompok 7 blok satuan ing sisih tengen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gambarna 26 nganggo model.</entry>
    <entry>2 puluhan lan 6 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289477512" alt="Gambar nampilake rong klompok sing saben-saben ngemot 10 kothak kanthi bingkai ing sisih kiwa lan 6 kothak satuan kanthi bingkai ing sisih tengen."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Gabungna.</entry>
    <entry>3 puluhan lan 13 satuan</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289744408" alt="Gambar nampilake telung klompok sing saben-saben ngemot 10 blok kanthi bingkai ing sisih kiwa lan 13 blok satuan kanthi bingkai ing sisih tengen. Sepuluh kothak satuan ing sisih tengen wernane abang."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Ijolna 10 satuan karo 1 puluhan.</entry>
    <entry>4 puluhan lan 3 satuan<newline />
    <m:math><m:mn>40</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289429860" alt="Gambar nampilake barisan persegi: telung baris sing saben-saben ngemot sepuluh persegi biru enom, sarta siji baris sepuluh persegi abang ing ngisore. Ing sisih tengen, telung persegi biru enom tambahan disusun horisontal."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_018_img-05.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita wis nuduhake yen <m:math><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry />
    <entry />
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1321704" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2137714">
<problem id="fs-id2645041">
<para id="fs-id1951300">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>27</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2483638">
<para id="fs-id1171105493268"><newline /><media id="fs-id1546073" alt="Gambar 15 + 27 = 42 nganggo blok basis-10 sing nampilake patang puluhan lan rong satuan.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_014_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1470537" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2813270">
<problem id="fs-id2379322">
<para id="fs-id2845299">Gambarna nganggo model panambahan: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2267850">
<para id="fs-id1171105192135"><newline /><media id="fs-id2197659" alt="Gambar nuduhake panambahan 16 + 29 = 45 nganggo blok basis-10. Patang baris sing saben-saben ngemot sepuluh blok makili 40, lan limang blok satuan makili 5, mula gunggunge 45. Asil panambahan ditulis ing ngisor blok.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_015_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id1385496"><title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah Tanpa Model</title><para id="fs-id2629808">Sawise nggunakake model kanggo nambah wilangan, saiki kita bisa nerusake panambahan tanpa model. Sadurunge nindakake, priksa manawa sampeyan wis nguwasani kabeh fakta panambahan siji digit. Fakta wilangan kasebut bakal dibutuhake nalika sampeyan nambah wilangan sing luwih gedhé.</para>
<para id="fs-id2137623">Bayangna sampeyan ngisi <link target-id="fs-id2300206" /> kanthi nambahake saben wilangan baris ing sisih kiwa karo saben wilangan kolom ing sisih ndhuwur. Priksa manawa sampeyan entuk saben gunggung sing ditampilake. Yen nemoni kangelan, gawea modele. Fakta wilangan sing durung dikuasani perlu dieling-eling supaya bisa digunakake kanthi cepet lan trep nalika nambah wilangan sing luwih gedhé.</para>
<table id="fs-id2300206" class="column-header">
<tgroup cols="11"><thead>
  <row valign="middle">
    <entry align="center">+</entry>
    <entry align="center">0</entry>
