    <entry align="center">16</entry>
    <entry align="center">17</entry>
    <entry align="center">18</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1516824">Apa sampeyan nggatekake kedadeyan nalika nol ditambahake marang sawijining wilangan? Gunggung wilangan apa wae lan nol yaiku wilangan kasebut dhewe. Iki diarani Sifat Identitas Panambahan. Nol diarani unsur identitas panambahan.</para><note id="fs-id3217986">
<title>Sifat Identitas Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id1960203">Gunggung wilangan apa wae <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> yaiku wilangan kasebut.</para><equation id="fs-id1858891" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr /><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></equation>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1502923"><exercise id="fs-id2323927"><problem id="fs-id2133097">
<para id="fs-id2287930">Temtokna saben gunggung iki: <list id="eip-id1168289479427" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>42</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id4363730">
<title>Panyelesaian</title><table id="eip-629" class="unnumbered unstyled" aria-label="Panyelesaian kanggo A: Suku panambahan kapisan yaiku nol. Gunggung wilangan apa wae lan nol yaiku wilangan kasebut. 0+11=11. Panyelesaian kanggo B: Suku panambahan kapindho yaiku nol. Gunggung wilangan apa wae lan nol yaiku wilangan kasebut. 42 + 0 = 42.">
<tgroup cols="2"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Suku panambahan kapisan yaiku nol. Gunggung wilangan apa wae lan nol yaiku wilangan kasebut.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Suku panambahan kapindho yaiku nol. Gunggung wilangan apa wae lan nol yaiku wilangan kasebut.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>42</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1387252" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1264596"><problem id="fs-id2751992">
<para id="fs-id1960514">Temtokna saben gunggung iki: <list id="eip-id1168287039629" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>39</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2144870">
<list id="eip-id1168289656112" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>39</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>39</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id2645953" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2362020"><problem id="fs-id2492225">
<para id="fs-id1936994">Temtokna saben gunggung iki: <list id="eip-id1168288581011" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>57</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math></item></list></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2788980">
<list id="eip-id1168287485680" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>24</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>57</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>57</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<para id="fs-id2777667">Gatekna pasangan asil panambahan iki.</para>
<para id="eip-583"><table id="eip-id1168287208889" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Nuduhake sifat komutatif panambahan: ngowahi urutan wilangan sing ditambahake ora ngowahi asile."><label /><tgroup cols="3"> <tbody>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math></entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:math></entry>

    <entry><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup></table></para><para id="fs-id2785833">Gatekna yen nalika urutan <term class="no-emphasis" id="term-00002">suku-suku panambahan</term> diwalik, gunggunge ora owah. Iki diarani Sifat Komutatif Panambahan, sing nyatakake yen ngowahi urutan suku-suku panambahan ora ngowahi gunggunge.</para><note id="fs-id1566118">
<title>Sifat Komutatif Panambahan</title>
<para id="fs-id1884628">Ngowahi urutan suku panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math> ora ngowahi gunggunge.</para><equation id="fs-id2670492" class="unnumbered"><label /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:mrow></m:math></equation>
</note>
<example id="fs-id2224023">
<exercise id="fs-id2454866"><problem id="fs-id2262840">
<para id="fs-id1816267">Tambahna: </para><list id="eip-id1168288474909" list-type="enumerated" class="circled" number-style="arabic"><item><span class="token">ⓐ</span> <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></item><item><span class="token">ⓑ</span> <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></item></list>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1824208">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<list id="eip-id1168288224691" list-type="labeled-item"><item>
<table id="eip-id1168288224694" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake tuladha operasi panambahan, yaiku 8 ditambah 7, sing ngasilake 15."><label /><tgroup cols="3">
<tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓐ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup></table></item>

<item>

<table id="eip-id11688224694" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Rincian soal panambahan 'ⓑ' sing nampilake ekspresi '7+8' lan asile '15'."><label /><tgroup cols="3">
<tbody>
  <row><entry><span class="token">ⓑ</span> </entry><entry /></row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>
</tgroup></table></item></list><para id="fs-id3218755">Apa sampeyan nggatekake yen ngowahi urutan suku-suku panambahan ora ngowahi gunggunge? Kita bisa langsung ngerti asil ing bagean <span class="token">ⓑ</span> kanthi ngenali yen suku-sukune padha karo ing bagean <span class="token">ⓐ</span>, nanging urutane diwalik. Mula, asil panambahane loro-lorone padha.</para></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1827619" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1968047">
<problem id="fs-id1960578">
<para id="fs-id1269366">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2170740">
<para id="fs-id2909034"><m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn><m:mo>; </m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2296788" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1577590">
<problem id="fs-id1603113">
<para id="fs-id892992">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1806629">
<para id="fs-id2283876"><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>; </m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id2686794"><exercise id="fs-id1578501">
<problem id="fs-id1368562">
<para id="fs-id2270260">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1791758">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1806085">Kanggo nambah wilangan sing digite luwih saka siji, biasane luwih gampang yen wilangan kasebut ditulis mudhun ing kolom.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168288293873" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake panambahan susun mudhun kanggo wilangan rong digit kanthi langkah-langkah, petunjuk lan wujud matematikane."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya digit satuan lan puluhane sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan. <newline />Tambahna satuan: <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tambahna puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math></entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>61</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>89</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id2698087" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2325520">
<problem id="fs-id2221948">
<para id="fs-id2648738">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2284818">
<para id="fs-id1374910"><m:math><m:mn>32</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>54</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>86</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1928992" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1275335">
<problem id="fs-id2562841">
<para id="fs-id1524844">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>74</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2951285">
<para id="fs-id968671"><m:math><m:mn>25</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>74</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>99</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id1340418">Ing tuladha sadurunge, gunggung satuan lan gunggung puluhan loro-lorone luwih cilik tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Nanging, apa sing kedadeyan yen gunggunge <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> utawa luwih? Ayo nggunakake model <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> kanggo mangerteni. <link target-id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001" /> nuduhake maneh panambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math>.</para>
<figure id="CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001"><media id="fs-id1231518" alt="Gambar ngemot rong klompok barang. Klompok kiwa dumadi saka 1 batang horisontal isi 10 blok lan 7 blok satuan, sarta 2 batang horisontal sing saben-saben isi 10 blok lan 6 blok satuan. Ing sisih kiwa klompok iki ana label “17 + 26 =”. Klompok tengen dumadi saka patang batang horisontal sing saben-saben ngemot 10 blok lan 3 blok satuan. Label klompok iki yaiku “17 + 26 = 43”.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_001.jpg" />
</media>
</figure><para id="fs-id2297149">Nalika kita nambah satuan, yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> kita entuk <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan. Amarga ana luwih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan, kita bisa ngijolake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan karo <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan. Saiki kita duwe <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> puluhan lan <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> satuan. Tanpa model, proses nyimpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure iki dituduhake nganggo angka abang cilik <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> ing ndhuwur digit ing panggonan puluhan.</para>
<para id="fs-id2877345">Yen gunggung ing sawijining kolom nilai panggonan luwih gedhé tinimbang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> kita nyimpen nilai menyang kolom sabanjure ing sisih kiwa. Proses nyimpen iki padha karo nglompokake maneh kanthi ijol-ijolan, kayata ngijolake <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> satuan karo <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan utawa <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> puluhan karo <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> atusan.</para>
<note id="fs-id1567373" class="howto"><title>Nambah wilangan cacah.</title><list id="eip-id1168288474750" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</item>
<item>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan. Garapen saka tengen menyang kiwa, wiwit panggonan satuan. Yen gunggung ing sawijining nilai panggonan luwih saka <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> simpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure.</item>
<item>Terusna nambah ing saben nilai panggonan saka tengen menyang kiwa lan simpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure yen perlu.</item></list></note><example id="fs-id1377666"><exercise id="fs-id2325655"><problem id="fs-id2785400">
<para id="fs-id1239115">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>69</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2566312">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-id1168287505854" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tuladha kanthi langkah-langkah sing nuduhake panambahan wilangan rong digit kanthi nyimpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure, nganggo 43 lan 69."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya digite sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>69</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
   <entry>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan.<newline />Tambahna satuan: <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:math></entry>
<entry />
</row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan satuan ing asil panambahan.<newline />Tambahna <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan menyang panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mover><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.1em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>69</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.1em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>

  <row>
    <entry>Saiki tambahna puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen 11 ing asil panambahan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mover><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.1em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>69</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>112</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.1em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>

</tbody>











</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example><note id="fs-id1257067" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2758260">
<problem id="fs-id1881610">
<para id="fs-id2370602">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>35</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>98</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2215223">
<para id="fs-id2278434"><m:math><m:mn>35</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>98</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>133</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id2325880" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1826280">
<problem id="fs-id2462708">
<para id="fs-id1517340">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>72</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1408807">
<para id="fs-id1580884"><m:math><m:mn>72</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>89</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>161</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1348056">
<exercise id="fs-id2277302"><problem id="fs-id2298083">
<para id="fs-id2139613">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>324</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>586</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2150007">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-id1168287251210" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Pandhuan langkah-langkah kanggo nambah wilangan multidigit kanthi tuladha gambar."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya digite sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168289818410" alt="Soal panambahan sing nambahake 324 karo 586."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_020-01.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan.<newline />Tambahna satuan: <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan satuan ing asil panambahan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan menyang panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287268641" alt="Soal panambahan 324 lan 586. Ing langkah kapisan, digit paling tengen ing rong wilangan kasebut ditambahake: 4 + 6 = 10. Angka 1 ditulis ing ndhuwur 2 lan 0 ditulis ing ngisor garis."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_020-02.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan ing asil panambahan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> atusan menyang panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287196613" alt="Soal panambahan susun ngemot 324 lan 586. Angka simpenan cilik 1 ditulis ing ndhuwur digit puluhan lan atusan ing 324. Ing ngisor garis ditampilake asil sauntara '10'."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_020-03.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna atusan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><media id="eip-id1168287121476" alt="Soal panambahan susun nuduhake 324 ditambah 586 padha karo 910, kanthi angka simpenan cilik 1 ing ndhuwur digit atusan lan puluhan ing suku kapisan."><image mime-type="image/png" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_020-04.png" /></media></entry>
  </row>

</tbody>












</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2648959" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1462931">
<problem id="fs-id2690850">
<para id="fs-id1376149">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>456</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1302654">
<para id="fs-id2906019"><m:math><m:mn>456</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>376</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>832</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1339924" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2267936">
<problem id="fs-id1298548">
<para id="fs-id1543215">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>269</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>578</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2146728">
<para id="fs-id1314815"><m:math><m:mn>269</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>578</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>847</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1988116">
<exercise id="fs-id2144790"><problem id="fs-id2280686">
<para id="fs-id2368411">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,683</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>479</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1372016">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-id1168288687380" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah nambah wilangan multidigit kanthi cara panambahan susun, kalebu nyimpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya digite sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>1,683</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
    <m:mtr />
    <m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna satuan: <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12.</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan satuan ing asil panambahan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> puluhan menyang panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>1,6</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
    <m:mtr />

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> atusan menyang panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr>
   <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>62</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna atusan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>11</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan atusan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> éwuan menyang panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>162</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna éwuan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math>.<newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan éwuan ing asil panambahan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mover><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="2em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>479</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>2,162</m:mn><m:mspace width="0.2em" /></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>

</tbody>










</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id2280341">Yen suku-suku panambahan nduweni cacah digit sing beda, sejajarna nilai panggonan sing cocog kanthi tliti, wiwit satuan banjur menyang kiwa.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2375137" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2174738">
<problem id="fs-id2278499">
<para id="fs-id2366246">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4,597</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>685</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2173908">
<para id="fs-id1328241"><m:math><m:mn>4,597</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>685</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>5,282</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1217416" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1367785">
<problem id="fs-id1409440">
<para id="fs-id2809228">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5,837</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>695</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1362543">
<para id="fs-id1605828"><m:math><m:mn>5,837</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>695</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6,532</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1801021">
<exercise id="fs-id2264879"><problem id="fs-id1883946">
<para id="fs-id1302204">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>21,357</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>861</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8,596</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2338420">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-id1168288531101" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Gambar langkah-langkah panambahan wilangan multidigit kanthi nyimpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure, diandharake miturut nilai panggonan."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya nilai panggonane sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>21,357</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna satuan: <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan satuan ing asil panambahan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> menyang panggonan puluhan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>21,3</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna puluhan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>21</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:math> menyang panggonan atusan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>21,</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">2</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna atusan: <m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:math><newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan atusan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> menyang panggonan éwuan.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mover><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">2</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>814</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna éwuan: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>10</m:mn></m:math>.<newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan éwuan lan simpen <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:math> menyang panggonan puluhan éwu.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mover><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">2</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>0814</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>
<row>
<entry>Tambahna puluhan éwu: <m:math><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math>.<newline />Tulisen <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> ing panggonan puluhan éwu ing asil panambahan.</entry>
<entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mover><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>1,</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">2</m:mn></m:mover><m:mover><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">1</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mrow><m:mn>861</m:mn></m:mrow></m:mtd></m:mtr> <m:mtr />
<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mspace width="3em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.4em" /><m:mn>8,596</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>_______</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr>

<m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="right"><m:mn>30,814</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry></row>

</tbody>







</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id1246087">Tuladha iki nduweni telung suku panambahan. Kita bisa nambah suku sepira wae cacahe kanthi proses sing padha, anggere saben nilai panggonan disejajarake kanthi trep.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id2684886" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2224340">
<problem id="fs-id1967102">
<para id="fs-id1881413">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>46,195</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>397</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6,281</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2924594">
<para id="fs-id1405279"><m:math><m:mn>46,195</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>397</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6,281</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>52,873</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1282502" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1406185">
<problem id="fs-id1184057">
<para id="fs-id1545934">Tambahna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>53,762</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>196</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7,458</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1351725">
<para id="fs-id834282"><m:math><m:mn>53,762</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>196</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>7,458</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>61,416</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section><section id="fs-id2691382">
<title>Ngowahi Frasa Tembung Dadi Notasi Matematika</title>
<para id="fs-id1612949">Sadurunge ing bagean iki, kita ngowahi notasi matematika dadi tembung. Saiki kita bakal mbalikke proses kasebut kanthi ngowahi frasa tembung dadi notasi matematika. Sawetara frasa sing nuduhake panambahan kacathet ing <link target-id="fs-id1826990" />.</para>
<table id="fs-id1826990" aria-label="Tabel kanthi rong baris lan patang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur yaiku baris irah-irahan. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, jeneng kolome yaiku operasi, tembung, tuladha, lan ekspresi. Ing baris sabanjure, kolom operasi ngemot panambahan; kolom tembung ngemot 'ditambah, gunggung, mundhak kanthi tambahan, minangka tambahan tumrap, gunggung saka, ditambahake marang'; kolom tuladha ngemot 1 ditambah 2, gunggung 3 lan 4, 5 mundhak kanthi tambahan 6, 8 minangka tambahan tumrap 7, gunggung 9 lan 5, sarta 6 ditambahake marang 4; kolom ekspresi ngemot 1 ditambah 2, 3 ditambah 4, 5 ditambah 6, 7 ditambah 8, 9 ditambah 5, lan 4 ditambah 6.">
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Tembung</entry>
<entry align="left">Tuladha</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry valign="top" align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left">ditambah<newline />gunggung<newline />mundhak kanthi tambahan<newline />minangka tambahan tumrap<newline />gunggung saka<newline />ditambahake marang</entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambah <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> minangka tambahan tumrap <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline />gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry valign="top" align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>7</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>8</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>9</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>5</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math><newline /><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<example id="fs-id1826874">
<exercise id="fs-id1392862"><problem id="fs-id1833382">
<para id="fs-id1950935">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1363349">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id2649934">Tembung <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung</emphasis> nuduhake yen kita perlu nambah. Frasa <emphasis effect="italics">gunggung</emphasis> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <emphasis effect="italics">lan</emphasis> <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> nuduhake rong suku panambahane.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168288294973" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngowahi soal panambahan wujud tembung dadi ekspresi matematika lan nemtokake gunggunge."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry />
    <entry>Gunggung <m:math><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>19</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row> <entry />
    <entry>Gunggung <m:math><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mn>42.</m:mn></m:math></entry>

  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1566729" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1932733">
<problem id="fs-id1375941">
<para id="fs-id2744730">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>17</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2211062">
<para id="fs-id2657242">Owahana dadi notasi matematika: <m:math><m:mn>17</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math>; prasajakna: <m:math><m:mn>43</m:mn></m:math>.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1387204" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1311804">
<problem id="fs-id2216187">
<para id="fs-id2774992">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1731443">
<para id="fs-id1585459">Owahana dadi notasi matematika: <m:math><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:math>; prasajakna: <m:math><m:mn>42</m:mn></m:math>.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<example id="fs-id1178091">
<exercise id="fs-id1330230"><problem id="fs-id1568191">
<para id="fs-id1968803">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>31</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1726814">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id1578716">Frasa <emphasis effect="italics">mundhak kanthi tambahan</emphasis> nuduhake yen kita perlu nambah. Wilangan sing diwenehake yaiku suku-suku panambahan.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168288520954" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Langkah-langkah kanggo ngowahi soal wujud tembung dadi ekspresi matematika lan ngrampungake."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row><entry />
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mn>31.</m:mn></m:math></entry>

  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>28</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>31</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tambahna.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>59</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>  <entry />
    <entry>Dadi, <m:math><m:mn>28</m:mn></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mn>31</m:mn></m:math> yaiku <m:math><m:mn> 59.</m:mn></m:math></entry>

  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1728016" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2130020">
<problem id="fs-id2370626">
<para id="fs-id2269129">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>29</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>76</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2164356">
<para id="fs-id2375959">Owahana dadi notasi matematika: <m:math><m:mn>29</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>76</m:mn></m:math>; prasajakna: <m:math><m:mn>105</m:mn></m:math>.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1933763" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2792137">
<problem id="fs-id1899406">
<para id="fs-id1549718">Owahana dadi notasi matematika lan prasajakna: <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>37</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mundhak kanthi tambahan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>69</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1410392">
<para id="fs-id2451444">Owahana dadi notasi matematika: 37 + 69; prasajakna: 106.</para></solution>
</exercise>
</note>
</section>
<section id="fs-id2197427">
<title>Nambah Wilangan Cacah ing Penerapan</title>
<para id="fs-id2926269">Sawise gladhen nambah wilangan cacah, ayo nggunakake kawruh kasebut kanggo ngrampungake masalah ing kahanan nyata. Kita miwiti kanthi nyusun rencana. Kapisan, wacanen soal kanggo nemtokake apa sing digoleki. Banjur, tulisen frasa tembung sing ngemot katrangan kanggo nemokake. Sabanjure, owahana frasa kasebut dadi notasi matematika banjur prasajakna. Pungkasan, tulisen ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon.</para>
<example id="fs-id1880782">
<exercise id="fs-id1899571"><problem id="fs-id4300687">
<para id="fs-id1746953">Hao entuk biji <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>87</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>93</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>68</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>95</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>89</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing limang tes sajrone semester kasebut. Pira gunggung kabeh poin sing dipikolehi ing limang tes kasebut?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1944399">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<para id="fs-id2265104">Kita dijaluk nemtokake gunggung kabeh poin tes.</para>
<table id="eip-id1168288617772" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Pandhuan langkah-langkah kanggo ngowahi frasa tembung dadi panambahan matematika lan ngetung gunggung kabeh poin."><tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining frasa.</entry>
    <entry>gunggung poin tes</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>87</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>93</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>68</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>95</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>89</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Banjur, prasajakna kanthi nambah.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Amarga ana sawetara wilangan, kita nulis kanthi susun mudhun.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mtable><m:mtr /><m:mtr /><m:mtr /><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mover><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mn mathsize="small">3</m:mn></m:mover><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mn>93</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mn>68</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="1em" /><m:mn>95</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.1em" /><m:munder accentunder="true"><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>89</m:mn></m:mrow><m:mtext>____</m:mtext></m:munder></m:mtd></m:mtr><m:mtr><m:mtd columnalign="left"><m:mspace width="0.51em" /><m:mn>432</m:mn></m:mtd></m:mtr></m:mtable></m:math></entry>
  </row>

  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon.</entry>
    <entry>Hao entuk gunggung 432 poin.</entry>
  </row>

</tbody>




</tgroup>
</table><para id="fs-id2703969">Gatekna yen kita nambah <emphasis effect="italics">poin</emphasis>, mula asile yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>432</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> <emphasis effect="italics">poin</emphasis>. Saben wangsulan soal penerapan kudu nyebutake satuan ukuran sing cocog.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1509280" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1564459">
<problem id="fs-id2176012">
<para id="fs-id1919047">Mark lagi gladhen kanggo balapan sepedha. Minggu kepungkur dheweke numpak sepedha adohe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Senen, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Rebo, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Jemuwah, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>49</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Setu, lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>32</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Minggu. Pira gunggung mil sing ditempuh minggu kepungkur?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2146653">
<para id="fs-id1390222">Dheweke numpak sepedha adohe 140 mil.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<note id="fs-id1512036" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id1761942">
<problem id="fs-id1294758">
<para id="fs-id2295551">Sekolah Menengah Lincoln nduweni telung tingkat kelas. Cacah siswa ing saben tingkat yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>230</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>165</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>325</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung kabeh siswane?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2296132">
<para id="fs-id1931675">Kabeh ana 720 siswa.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</note>
<para id="fs-id2594070">Sawetara soal penerapan gegayutan karo bangun. Upamane, wong perlu mangerteni jarak ngubengi kebon kanggo masang pager utawa jarak ngubengi gambar kanggo masang bingkai. Keliling yaiku jarak sing ngubengi sawijining bangun geometri. Keliling bangun yaiku gunggung dawane sisi-sisine.</para><example id="fs-id1894829">
<exercise id="fs-id1628979"><problem id="fs-id1511502">
<para id="fs-id908485">Temtokna keliling teras sing ditampilake.</para>
<media id="fs-id588598" alt="Gambar nuduhake wates teras kanthi enem sisi. Sisi paling kiwa diwenehi label 4 foot, sisi ndhuwur 9 foot, sisi cekak ing tengen 2 foot, banjur sisi sing mujur menyang kiwa 3 foot. Saka kono, sisi sabanjure mujur mudhun kanthi label 2 foot. Sisi ngisor diwenehi label 6 foot.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_002.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1568241">
<title>Panyelesaian</title>
<table id="eip-id1168289453960" class="unnumbered unstyled" summary="Tabel iki nuduhake langkah-langkah ngetung keliling sawijining barang, wiwit nemtokake masalah nganti menehi wangsulan pungkasan.">
<tgroup cols="3"><tbody>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita dijaluk nemtokake keliling.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining frasa.</entry>
    <entry>gunggung dawane sisi-sisi</entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Owahana dadi notasi matematika.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Prasajakna kanthi nambah.</entry>
    <entry><m:math><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math></entry>
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Tulisen sawijining ukara kanggo mangsuli pitakon.</entry>
    <entry />
  </row>
  <row>
    <entry>Kita nambah ukuran ing foot, mula asile <m:math><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math> foot.</entry>
    <entry>Keliling teras yaiku <m:math><m:mn>26</m:mn></m:math> foot.</entry>
  </row>
</tbody>

</tgroup>
</table></solution>
</exercise></example>
<note id="fs-id1378644" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2483376"><problem id="fs-id1542511">
<para id="fs-id1365334">Temtokna keliling bangun kasebut. Kabeh dawa diukur ing inci.</para>
<media id="fs-id2175999" alt="Gambar ngemot 8 sisi. Sisi kapisan ing kiwa diwenehi label 4 inci, sisi kapindho ing ndhuwur 9 inci, sisi katelu ing tengen 4 inci, sisi kapapat 3 inci, sisi kalima 2 inci, sisi keenem 3 inci, sisi kapitu 2 inci, lan sisi kawolu 3 inci.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_003.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2284683">
<para id="fs-id1357069">Kelilinge yaiku 30 inci.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id1405610" class="try">
<exercise id="fs-id2427950"><problem id="fs-id1225224">
<para id="fs-id1884028">Temtokna keliling bangun kasebut. Kabeh dawa diukur ing inci.</para>
<media id="fs-id1381557" alt="Gambar ngemot 8 sisi. Yen nututi arah jarum jam, sisi kapisan diwenehi label 2 inci, sisi kapindho 12 inci, sisi katelu 6 inci, sisi kapapat 4 inci, sisi kalima 2 inci, sisi keenem 4 inci, sisi kapitu 2 inci, lan sisi kawolu 4 inci.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_004.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2136690">
<para id="fs-id1613173">Kelilinge yaiku 36 inci.</para>
</solution>
</exercise></note>
<note id="fs-id719196" class="media-2"><title>AKSES SUMBER DARING TAMBAHAN</title><list id="fs-id1176422" display="block">
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24add2blocks">Nambah Wilangan Rong Digit nganggo Blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24add3blocks">Nambah Wilangan Telung Digit nganggo Blok <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>Basis-10</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math></link></item>
<item><link url="https://www.openstax.org/l/24addwhlnumb">Nambah Wilangan Cacah</link></item>
</list>
</note></section>
<section id="fs-id1611455" class="key-concepts">
<title>Konsep Pokok</title>
<list id="eip-588"><item><emphasis>Notasi Panambahan</emphasis> Kanggo nerangake panambahan, kita bisa nggunakake simbol lan tembung. <table id="eip-id1170324017502" class="unnumbered" aria-label="Tabel kanthi rong baris lan limang kolom. Baris paling ndhuwur yaiku baris irah-irahan. Saka kiwa menyang tengen, kolom kasebut diwenehi label Operasi, Notasi, Ekspresi, Diwaca, lan Asil. Ing baris kapindho, saka kiwa menyang tengen, ana panambahan, tandha tambah, ekspresi 3 ditambah 4, wacan telu ditambah papat, lan gunggung 3 lan 4.">
<label />
<tgroup cols="5">
<colspec colnum="1" colname="c1" />
<colspec colnum="2" colname="c2" />
<colspec colnum="3" colname="c3" />
<colspec colnum="4" colname="c4" />
<colspec colnum="5" colname="c5" />
<thead>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Operasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Notasi</entry>
<entry align="left">Ekspresi</entry>
<entry align="left">Diwaca</entry>
<entry align="left">Asil</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row valign="top">
<entry align="left">Panambahan</entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mo>+</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>3</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></entry>
<entry align="left">telu ditambah papat</entry>
<entry align="left">gunggung <m:math><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:math></entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table> </item>
<item><emphasis>Sifat Identitas Panambahan</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170325229876">
<item>Gunggung wilangan apa wae <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn></m:math> yaiku wilangan kasebut. <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> <m:math><m:mn>0</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math></item></list></item>
<item><emphasis>Sifat Komutatif Panambahan</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170325285133"><item>Ngowahi urutan suku panambahan <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mi>b</m:mi></m:math> ora ngowahi gunggunge. <m:math><m:mi>a</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mi>b</m:mi><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mi>a</m:mi></m:math>.</item></list></item>
<item><emphasis>Nambah wilangan cacah.</emphasis>
<list id="eip-id1170325253924" list-type="enumerated" number-style="arabic" class="stepwise"><item>Tulisen wilangan kasebut supaya saben nilai panggonan sejajar saka ndhuwur mudhun.</item>
<item>Tambahna digit ing saben nilai panggonan. Garapen saka tengen menyang kiwa, wiwit panggonan satuan. Yen gunggung ing sawijining nilai panggonan luwih saka 9, simpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure.</item>
<item>Terusna nambah ing saben nilai panggonan saka tengen menyang kiwa lan simpen nilai menyang panggonan sabanjure yen perlu.</item></list></item>
</list></section>
<section id="fs-id2263283" class="section-exercises"><section id="fs-id2150139" class="practice-perfect"><title>Gladhen Supaya Trampil</title><para id="fs-id1459553"><emphasis effect="bold">Nggunakake Notasi Panambahan</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-17">Ing gladhen iki, owahana ekspresi matematika dadi tembung.</para><exercise id="fs-id1386835">
<problem id="fs-id1858965">
<para id="fs-id2216300"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>2</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1179382">
<para id="fs-id2950606">lima ditambah loro; gunggung 5 lan 2.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2169300">
<problem id="fs-id2479159">
<para id="fs-id1562356"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>6</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2649783">
<problem id="fs-id2472855">
<para id="fs-id2295555"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2284590">
<para id="fs-id2921067">telulas ditambah wolulas; gunggung 13 lan 18.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2267610">
<problem id="fs-id2300838">
<para id="fs-id1201688"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>15</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>16</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2479137">
<problem id="fs-id1565693">
<para id="fs-id1742068"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>214</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>642</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2649549">
<para id="fs-id2300447">rong atus patbelas ditambah nem atus patang puluh loro; gunggung 214 lan 642</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2459088">
<problem id="fs-id2658520">
<para id="fs-id1208667"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>438</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>113</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2925322"><emphasis effect="bold">Nggambarake Panambahan Wilangan Cacah nganggo Model</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-987">Ing gladhen iki, gambarna panambahane nganggo model.</para><exercise id="fs-id2431569">
<problem id="fs-id1728216">
<para id="fs-id1408830"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2730040">
<para id="fs-id1171105187236"><newline /><media id="fs-id2751367" alt="Gambar nggunakake blok kanggo nuduhake panambahan wilangan cacah, ing kene 2 + 4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_201_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<para id="fs-id1461649"><m:math><m:mn>2</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>6</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2210891">
<problem id="fs-id1040799">
<para id="fs-id1405615"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>3</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1583137">
<problem id="fs-id1246687">
<para id="fs-id1467513"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1899515">
<para id="fs-id1171105186388"><newline /><media id="fs-id1548483" alt="Gambar nggunakake blok kanggo nuduhake panambahan wilangan cacah, ing kene 8 + 4.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_203_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<para id="fs-id2678643"><m:math><m:mn>8</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>4</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1389381">
<problem id="fs-id1370774">
<para id="fs-id2658396"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>5</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>9</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1932178">
<problem id="fs-id2835377">
<para id="fs-id1607967"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>75</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1605815">
<para id="fs-id1171105284820"><newline /><media id="fs-id2568159" alt="Gambar nggunakake blok kanggo nuduhake panambahan wilangan cacah, ing kene 14 + 75.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_205_img.jpg" />
</media></para>
<para id="fs-id2820243"><m:math><m:mn>14</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>75</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>89</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
