<para id="fs-id1262565"><emphasis effect="bold">Ngowahi Frasa Tembung Dadi Notasi Matematika</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-527">Ing gladhen iki, owahana saben frasa dadi notasi matematika, banjur prasajakna.</para><exercise id="fs-id2387977">
<problem id="fs-id2179698">
<para id="fs-id1394583">gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>13</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>18</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id934090">
<para id="fs-id1827165"><m:math><m:mn>13</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>18</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>31</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
