</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1760728">
<problem id="fs-id1397964">
<para id="fs-id1836854"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>250</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> minangka tambahan tumrap <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>599</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1480647">
<para id="fs-id1826480"><m:math><m:mn>599</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>250</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>849</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2671623">
<problem id="fs-id2146075">
<para id="fs-id1880793"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>115</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> minangka tambahan tumrap <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>286</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1606377">
<problem id="fs-id1835123">
<para id="fs-id1785250">gunggung kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>628</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>77</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1944908">
<para id="fs-id1509499"><m:math><m:mn>628</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>77</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>705</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1614332">
<problem id="fs-id2619707">
<para id="fs-id2174343">gunggung kabeh <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>593</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>79</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2281219">
<problem id="fs-id2129977">
<para id="fs-id2265450"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1,482</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>915</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2144836">
<para id="fs-id2264496"><m:math><m:mn>915</m:mn><m:mo>+</m:mo><m:mn>1,482</m:mn><m:mo>=</m:mo><m:mn>2,397</m:mn></m:math></para></solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1159676">
<problem id="fs-id2478495">
<para id="fs-id1786725"><m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>2,719</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ditambahake marang <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>682</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math></para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id1458706"><emphasis effect="bold">Nambah Wilangan Cacah ing Penerapan</emphasis> </para><para id="eip-222">Ing gladhen iki, rampungna masalahe.</para><exercise id="fs-id2195542">
<problem id="fs-id1760965">
<para id="fs-id1747338"><emphasis effect="bold">Ndandani omah</emphasis> Sophia ndandani pawone lan tuku kompor, oven gelombang mikro, sarta mesin pangumbah piring anyar. Regane kompor kasebut <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$1,100</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> regane oven gelombang mikro <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$250</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan regane mesin pangumbah piring <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$525</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung ragad telung piranti kasebut?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1801474">
<para id="fs-id1408146">Gunggung ragade yaiku $1,875.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2452678">
<problem id="fs-id2788930">
<para id="fs-id2214138"><emphasis effect="bold">Piranti olahraga</emphasis> Aiden tuku piranti gebug bisbol, helm, lan sarung tangan. Regane piranti gebug kasebut <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$299</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> regane helm <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$35</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan regane sarung tangan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$68</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung ragad kabeh piranti olahraga Aiden?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2264366">
<problem id="fs-id2135940">
<para id="fs-id1968068"><emphasis effect="bold">Numpak sepedha</emphasis> Ethan numpak sepedha adohe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>14</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Senen, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Selasa, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Rebo, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>25</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Jemuwah, lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>68</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> mil ing dina Setu. Pira gunggung mil sing ditempuh Ethan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1722779">
<para id="fs-id1374526">Ethan numpak sepedha adohe 138 mil.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1401775">
<problem id="fs-id1827632">
<para id="fs-id1739127"><emphasis effect="bold">Usaha</emphasis> Chloe duwe toko kembang. Minggu kepungkur dheweke nggawe <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>19</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> rangkéan kembang ing dina Senen, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>12</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Selasa, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>23</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Rebo, <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>29</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Kemis, lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>44</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> ing dina Jemuwah. Pira gunggung kabeh rangkéan kembang sing digawe Chloe?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2609576">
<problem id="fs-id2198580">
<para id="fs-id1835026"><emphasis effect="bold">Jembar apartemen</emphasis> Jackson manggon ing apartemen kanthi <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ruwang. Jembar saben ruwang ing foot persegi yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>238</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>120</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>156</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>196</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>100</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>132</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>225</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung jembar <m:math><m:mn>7</m:mn></m:math> ruwang kasebut ing foot persegi?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2474540">
<para id="fs-id1386098">Gunggung jembar kabeh ruwang yaiku 1,167 foot persegi.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1946723">
<problem id="fs-id2375146">
<para id="fs-id1321612"><emphasis effect="bold">Bobot</emphasis> Pitung priya nyewa prau kanggo mancing. Bobote yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>175</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>192</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>148</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>169</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>205</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>181</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>225</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Pira gunggung bobot pitung priya kasebut?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1962359">
<problem id="fs-id1280684">
<para id="fs-id1352275"><emphasis effect="bold">Gaji</emphasis> Taun kepungkur, gajine Natalie yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$82,572</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Rong taun kepungkur, gajine yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$79,316</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan telung taun kepungkur gajine <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$75,298</m:mtext><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung kabeh gajine Natalie sajrone telung taun pungkasan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1957190">
<para id="fs-id2164332">Gunggung kabeh gajine Natalie yaiku $237,186.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1410524">
<problem id="fs-id2136860">
<para id="fs-id2730706"><emphasis effect="bold">Adol omah</emphasis> Emma yaiku agen properti. Sasi kepungkur, dheweke adol telung omah. Rega adol omah-omah kasebut yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>$292,540</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>$505,875</m:mtext><m:mo>,</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> lan <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>$423,699</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Pira gunggung telung rega adol kasebut?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<para id="fs-id2789052">Ing gladhen iki, temtokna keliling saben bangun.</para>
<exercise id="fs-id2658194">
<problem id="fs-id2466163">
<media id="fs-id3323886" alt="Gambar segitiga kanthi dawa sisi 14 inci, 12 inci, lan 18 inci.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_208_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id764274">
<para id="fs-id1910210">Keliling bangun kasebut yaiku 44 inci.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2130628">
<problem id="fs-id1739372">
<media id="fs-id1920954" alt="Gambar segitiga siku-siku kanthi alas 12 sentimeter, dhuwur 5 sentimeter, lan sisi miring 13 sentimeter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_209_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1718142">
<problem id="fs-id1800041">
<media id="fs-id1509030" alt="Persegi panjang kanthi amba 21 meter lan dhuwur 7 meter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_210_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1786922">
<para id="fs-id2599809">Keliling bangun kasebut yaiku 56 meter.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id2173206">
<problem id="fs-id1945450">
<media id="fs-id1409007" alt="Persegi panjang kanthi amba 19 foot lan dhuwur 14 foot.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_211_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1788660"><problem id="fs-id2220439">
<media id="fs-id1386731" alt="Trapesium kanthi sisi ndhuwur horisontal dawane 19 yard, rong sisi miring saben-saben dawane 18 yard, lan sisi ngisor horisontal dawane 16 yard.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_212_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1462641">
<para id="fs-id1918111">Keliling bangun kasebut yaiku 71 yard.</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1321391"><problem id="fs-id2261883">
<media id="fs-id2453797" alt="Trapesium kanthi sisi ndhuwur horisontal dawane 24 meter, rong sisi miring saben-saben dawane 17 meter, lan sisi ngisor horisontal dawane 29 meter.">
<image mime-type="image/jpeg" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_213_img.jpg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id2427822"><problem id="fs-id1933947">
<media id="fs-id1727317" alt="Gambar meh kaya persegi panjang kanthi enem sisi. Wiwit pojok kiwa ndhuwur, sisi kapisan mujur 24 foot menyang tengen. Saka pucuke, sisi kapindho mujur 7 foot mudhun. Banjur sisi katelu mujur 19 foot menyang kiwa. Sisi kapapat mujur 3 foot munggah. Sisi kalima mujur 5 foot menyang kiwa. Sisi keenem mujur 4 foot munggah lan ketemu karo wiwitan sisi kapisan ing sawijining pojok.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_214_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id2597307">
<para id="fs-id764492">Keliling bangun kasebut yaiku 62 foot.</para>
</solution>
</exercise><exercise id="fs-id1960065"><problem id="fs-id2172560">
<media id="fs-id2316211" alt="Gambar kanthi 6 sisi lurus. Wiwit pojok kiwa ndhuwur, sisi kapisan mujur 25 inci menyang tengen. Saka pucuke, sisi kapindho mujur 10 inci mudhun. Banjur sisi katelu mujur 14 inci menyang kiwa. Sisi kapapat mujur 7 inci munggah. Sisi kalima mujur 11 inci menyang kiwa. Sisi keenem mujur munggah lan ketemu karo wiwitan sisi kapisan ing sawijining pojok.">
<image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_01_02_215_img.jpg.id-ID.svg" />
</media>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="fs-id2280700" class="everyday">
<title>Matematika Saben Dina</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1606437">
<problem id="fs-id3217928">
<para id="fs-id1947377"><emphasis effect="bold">Kalori</emphasis> Nalika mangan awan, Paulette mangan salad pitik panggang nganggo saos ranch lan omben ukuran <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>16 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Ing tabel katrangan gizi restoran, dheweke weruh yen saben panganan ngemot kalori kaya ing ngisor iki:</para>
<para id="fs-id1262668">Salad pitik panggang – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>320</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Saos ranch – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>170</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Omben <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>16 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>150</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori</para>
<para id="fs-id2806755">Pira gunggung kabeh kalori ing panganan awane Paulette?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1880768">
<para id="fs-id1548221">Gunggung kabeh kalorine yaiku 640.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1215287">
<problem id="fs-id2294699">
<para id="fs-id1911016"><emphasis effect="bold">Kalori</emphasis> Nalika mangan bengi, Fred mangan roti lapis pitik panggang, sakporsi cilik kenthang goreng, lan susu kocok coklat ukuran <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>12 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math>. Tabel katrangan gizi restoran nyathet kalori saben panganan kaya ing ngisor iki:</para>
<para id="fs-id1321648">Roti lapis pitik panggang – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>420</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Kenthang goreng porsi cilik – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>230</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori<newline />
Susu kocok coklat <m:math><m:mrow><m:mtext>12 fluid ounce AS</m:mtext></m:mrow></m:math> – <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>580</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> kalori</para>
<para id="fs-id2307453">Pira gunggung kabeh kalori ing panganan bengine Fred?</para>
</problem>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1567863">
<problem id="fs-id1394827">
<para id="fs-id2270985"><emphasis effect="bold">Biji tes</emphasis> Sawijining siswa mbutuhake gunggung <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>400</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> poin saka limang tes supaya lulus sawijining mata pelajaran. Siswa kasebut entuk biji <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>82</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>91</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>75</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>88</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>70</m:mn><m:mo>.</m:mo></m:mrow></m:math> Apa siswa kasebut lulus?</para></problem>
<solution id="fs-id1171103481776">
<para id="fs-id1171105500772">Iya, siswa kasebut entuk 406 poin.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1369108">
<problem id="fs-id1530557">
<para id="fs-id2684871"><emphasis effect="bold">Lift</emphasis> Kapasitas bobot paling gedhé sawijining lift yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>1150</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Ana enem priya ing sajrone lift. Bobote yaiku <m:math><m:mrow><m:mn>210</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>145</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>183</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>230</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mn>159</m:mn><m:mo>,</m:mo><m:mtext>lan</m:mtext><m:mspace width="0.2em" /><m:mn>164</m:mn></m:mrow></m:math> pound. Apa gunggung bobote luwih cilik tinimbang kapasitas paling gedhé lift?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-idm275747712">
<para id="fs-idm278477024">Iya, gunggung bobote yaiku 1091 pound.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
</section>
<section id="fs-id1405751" class="writing">
<title>Gladhen Nulis</title>
<exercise id="fs-id1408863">
<problem id="fs-id2912531">
<para id="fs-id2267341">Sepira yakine sampeyan wis nguwasani fakta-fakta panambahan? Yen durung yakin kabeh, apa sing bakal sampeyan tindakake kanggo nambah katrampilan?</para>
</problem>
<solution id="fs-id1604802">
<para id="fs-id1149222">Wangsulan bisa beda-beda.</para>
</solution>
</exercise>
<exercise id="fs-id1827602">
<problem id="fs-id1465007">
<para id="fs-id1379335">Kepiye sampeyan nggunakake model kanggo mbantu nyinaoni fakta-fakta panambahan?</para>
</problem>
</exercise></section><section id="eip-985" class="self-check"><title>Priksa Dhewe</title><para id="eip-464"><span class="token">ⓐ</span> Sawise ngrampungake gladhen, gunakna daftar priksa iki kanggo mbiji anggon sampeyan nguwasani ancas bagean iki.
</para>

<figure id="eip-id1168469634010" class="unnumbered"><label /><media id="eip-id1168469634014" alt="Bagan pambiji mandiri mbantu siswa mbiji katrampilan panambahan, wiwit nggunakake notasi nganti ngetrapake wilangan cacah. Kategorine yaiku Yakin, Kanthi pitulungan sethithik, lan Ora—aku durung mangerteni!"><image mime-type="image/svg+xml" src="../../media/CNX_BMath_Figure_AppB_002_A.jpg.id-ID.svg" /></media></figure><para id="eip-id1168466075811"><span class="token">ⓑ</span> Sawise mriksa daftar iki maneh, apa sing bakal sampeyan tindakake supaya yakin nguwasani kabeh ancas?
</para></section></section></content>
<glossary>
<definition id="fs-id1226736">
<term>gunggung</term>
<meaning id="fs-id1245763">Gunggung yaiku asil panambahan rong wilangan utawa luwih.</meaning>
</definition>
</glossary>
</document>
